OL,3,GNEWSABudget help welcomed but with
OL,4,Apleas for much more
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile help to ease rising cost
OL,7,Fannounced in Chancellor John Healey's
OL,8,FBudget have been welcomed, some
OL,9,Fresidents and businesses across the
OL,10,FNorth East and Cumbria said they do not
OL,11,Fgo nearly far enough.
OL,13,FIn the first Budget since Andy Burnham
OL,14,Fbecame Prime Minster, families facing
OL,15,Fcost-of-living pressures are being
OL,16,Foffered some "breathing space", as
OL,17,FHealey put it.
OL,19,FAnnouncements include support with
OL,20,Fenergy bills, tax cuts - and increases
OL,21,F- as well as changes affecting wages,
OL,22,Fbenefits, pensions and housing.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
